  "html": "<article id=\"post-5762\" class=\"container post-5762 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry type-of-service-maintenance\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-wrench\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\"><strong>Home Maintenance Plans in Chesapeake, VA </strong></h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Preventative care for your heating, cooling, plumbing, and electrical systems.</em>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A system that gets regular care tends to fail less often and last longer than one that only gets attention after something breaks. Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical offers maintenance plans for homeowners and businesses throughout Chesapeake and the surrounding Hampton Roads area, covering HVAC, <a href=\"/services/plumbing-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">plumbing</a>, and <a href=\"/services/electrical-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">electrical</a> systems individually or bundled together.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Choose a standalone plan for one system, or the bundled Premium Home Care Agreement for comprehensive coverage across your home&#8217;s heating, cooling, plumbing, and electrical systems. A separate Generator Care Agreement is also available for homes with a backup generator.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician inspecting an air duct with a customer\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-inspecting-an-air-duct-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" title=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician inspecting an air duct with a customer - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 has-primary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card mt-5 p-3 border-radius-sm flow align-self-center card--wide has-white-background-color\" style=\"\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-decorator h-decorator--primary is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Premium Home Care Agreement</h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"mt-2 wp-block-paragraph\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical&#8217;s maintenance plans ensure efficiency and longevity for your home&#8217;s systems, offering flexibility with standalone services or bundled options covering HVAC, Plumbing, and Electrical needs.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-3 mt-2 border-radius-xs has-gray-light-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-home-with-checkmark\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Emergency Service Response:</strong> Count on Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical for prompt emergency assistance, ensuring your home’s systems are back up and running in no time.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-note\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Priority Scheduling:</strong> Enjoy the convenience of priority scheduling, guaranteeing timely service appointments and efficient maintenance for your home’s major systems.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-wrench\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Regular Maintenance:</strong> Stay ahead with regular maintenance plans from Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, ensuring optimal performance and longevity for your home&#8217;s plumbing, electric, and HVAC systems.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-price-change\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Discounts on Repairs:</strong> Save on repair costs with Russell&#8217;s maintenance plans, benefitting from discounted rates for repairs and replacements to keep your home running smoothly.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mobile-wrap-and-center align-flex-end w100 is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card__price is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fba139f5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"text-uppercase text-upper wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta position-relative\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card mt-5 p-3 border-radius-sm flow align-self-center card--wide has-white-background-color\" style=\"\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-decorator h-decorator--primary is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Generator Care Agreement</h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"mt-2 wp-block-paragraph\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical&#8217;s Generator Care Agreement delivers peace of mind to homeowners with discounts on repairs, service fees, and comprehensive yearly maintenance, ensuring generator reliability.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-3 mt-2 border-radius-xs has-gray-light-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-home-with-checkmark\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>20% Discount:</strong> Save on service and diagnostic fees, ensuring cost-effective maintenance for your home generator.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-note\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>15% Discount:</strong> Enjoy reduced costs on parts and labor for generator repairs, providing value and reliability.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mobile-wrap-and-center align-flex-end w100 is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card__price is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fba139f5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"text-uppercase text-upper wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta position-relative\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- container /--><div  class=\"types-of-service-container container\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">What a Maintenance Plan Includes </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>A maintenance plan covers the scheduled visits and service benefits that keep your systems running efficiently between repairs, rather than waiting for something to fail before a technician looks at it. Plan members get priority scheduling, regular maintenance visits, and discounted rates if a repair is needed, along with faster emergency response when something does go wrong.</p>\n<p>Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical offers maintenance coverage through:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual System Plans: Standalone maintenance coverage for HVAC, plumbing, or electrical systems.</li>\n<li>Premium Home Care Agreement: Bundled coverage across HVAC, plumbing, and electrical systems in one plan.</li>\n<li>Generator Care Agreement: Dedicated coverage for home generators, including 20% off service and diagnostic fees and 15% off parts and labor for repairs.</li>\n<li>Emergency Service Response: Priority response for plan members when a covered system fails.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-money\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Why a Maintenance Plan Is Worth It </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Emergency repairs almost always cost more than the same problem caught during a scheduled maintenance visit, since a technician can catch a worn part or a developing issue before it causes a bigger failure. Regular maintenance also keeps systems running at their intended efficiency, which shows up as lower utility bills over time, and it is one of the most reliable ways to extend the working life of a furnace, air conditioner, or plumbing system.</p>\n<p>For homeowners who would rather budget for predictable, scheduled visits than face a surprise repair bill, a maintenance plan trades an unpredictable expense for a planned one, with the added benefit of priority scheduling when something does come up. <a href=\"/financing\">Financing</a> remains available separately when a visit surfaces a larger repair.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician-gears\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Why Choose Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical for Maintenance Plans </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical has served Hampton Roads since 1977, and our maintenance plans are built around keeping your systems reliable, not just checking a box once a year.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serving Hampton Roads Since 1977: We have maintained this region&#8217;s heating, cooling, plumbing, and electrical systems for decades under the same name.</li>\n<li>Priority Scheduling: Plan members get priority appointment scheduling ahead of non-members.</li>\n<li>Discounted Repairs: Plan members save on repair costs when a covered system needs attention.</li>\n<li>Flexible Coverage: Choose a single-system plan, the bundled Premium Home Care Agreement, or the Generator Care Agreement.</li>\n<li>Online Scheduling: Book your maintenance visits on your own time without waiting on hold.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">How Our Maintenance Plans Work </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <ul>\n<li>Call or schedule online. Speak with our team about which plan fits your home&#8217;s systems.</li>\n<li>Choose your coverage. Select an individual system plan, the Premium Home Care Agreement, or the Generator Care Agreement.</li>\n<li>Get your scheduled visits. Regular maintenance appointments are scheduled at the interval that fits your systems.</li>\n<li>Get priority when you need it. Plan members receive priority scheduling and discounted repair rates.</li>\n<li>Keep your systems running longer. Ongoing care is completed with the same commitment to quality on every visit.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #e22833\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What is included in the Premium Home Care Agreement? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>The Premium Home Care Agreement bundles maintenance coverage for your HVAC, plumbing, and electrical systems into a single plan, including regular maintenance visits, priority scheduling, emergency service response, and discounts on repairs.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What discounts come with the Generator Care Agreement? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>The Generator Care Agreement includes a 20% discount on service and diagnostic fees and a 15% discount on parts and labor for generator repairs, along with comprehensive yearly maintenance.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Can I get a maintenance plan for just one system? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. Individual maintenance plans are available for HVAC, plumbing, or electrical systems on their own, in addition to the bundled Premium Home Care Agreement that covers all three.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How much does a maintenance plan cost? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Cost depends on which plan or combination of systems you choose. Call our team to discuss which plan fits your home and get specific pricing.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How often are maintenance visits scheduled? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Most HVAC plans include two visits a year, one before the cooling season and one before the heating season, while plumbing and electrical inspections typically run annually. Our team confirms the exact schedule for your plan when you enroll.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n\n        <div  class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head\">\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo\">            <svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.3 35.2\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 107.3 35.2;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><title>Google</title><path fill=\"#4885ED\" d=\"M26.4,12.4H13.9v3.7h8.9c-0.4,5.2-4.8,7.4-8.9,7.4c-5.4,0-9.8-4.3-9.8-9.7c0-0.1,0-0.1,0-0.2 c0-5.6,4.4-10,9.8-10c4.2,0,6.7,2.7,6.7,2.7l2.6-2.7c0,0-3.3-3.7-9.4-3.7C6,0,0,6.5,0,13.6c0,6.9,5.6,13.7,14,13.7 c7.3,0,12.7-5,12.7-12.4C26.6,13.3,26.4,12.4,26.4,12.4L26.4,12.4z\"/><g><path id=\"A\" fill=\"#DB3236\" d=\"M36.6,9.7c-5.1,0-8.8,4-8.8,8.7c0,4.8,3.6,8.8,8.9,8.8c4.8,0,8.7-3.7,8.7-8.7 C45.4,12.7,40.9,9.7,36.6,9.7L36.6,9.7z M36.7,13.2c2.5,0,4.9,2,4.9,5.3c0,3.2-2.4,5.3-4.9,5.3c-2.8,0-5-2.2-5-5.3 C31.7,15.4,33.9,13.2,36.7,13.2L36.7,13.2z\"/></g><g><path id=\"A_00000019641008515513977120000006682861592563020936_\" fill=\"#F4C20D\" d=\"M55.8,9.7c-5.1,0-8.8,4-8.8,8.7 c0,4.8,3.6,8.8,8.9,8.8c4.8,0,8.7-3.7,8.7-8.7C64.6,12.7,60,9.7,55.8,9.7L55.8,9.7z M55.9,13.2c2.5,0,4.9,2,4.9,5.3 c0,3.2-2.4,5.3-4.9,5.3c-2.8,0-5-2.2-5-5.3C50.9,15.4,53,13.2,55.9,13.2L55.9,13.2z\"/></g><path fill=\"#4885ED\" d=\"M74.6,9.7c-4.7,0-8.4,4.1-8.4,8.8c0,5.3,4.3,8.8,8.3,8.8c2.5,0,3.8-1,4.8-2.1v1.7c0,3-1.8,4.8-4.6,4.8 c-2.7,0-4-2-4.5-3.1L66.9,30c1.2,2.5,3.6,5.2,7.9,5.2c4.7,0,8.3-3,8.3-9.1V10.3h-3.7v1.5C78.2,10.5,76.7,9.7,74.6,9.7L74.6,9.7z M75,13.2c2.3,0,4.7,2,4.7,5.3c0,3.4-2.4,5.