ling with a leak for a few years, had different companies come out and no one could properly find or fix the issue. Russell’s-American Mechanical came out and found and fixed the problem in no time. The technician was honest, considerate and informed us on other things as well. Will definitely continue with Russell’s-American Mechanical for all future projects.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"John Sutphln\" aria-label=\"John Sutphln\">John Sutphln</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>They did a great job and cleaned up after themselves! Great company. They were very responsive when I called to get an estimate for plumbing repair. Very please with the company. Came back to fix the plumbing and everything seems to be working well!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Jackie\" aria-label=\"Jackie\">Jackie</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>This is a fantastic company. They did excellent work replacing one of our units. The staff is friendly, respectful, knowledgeable, hard-working, and they really went above and beyond to take care of our unit replacement. I would highly recommend this company.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-ca